{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food Facility</strong> is a game where you build a complex factory to produce food as efficiently as possible\u2014all within the tight space you're given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/a412e3936ec251d8424fe6266340e478.avif?t=1759064964\" width=616 height=352 /></span><strong><u></u></strong><br><strong><u>Droppers</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Droppers release ingredients that can be combined, compressed, mixed, and more. Discover multiple ways to transform these items into food products\u2014some conventional, others... not so much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/574a82fdca34f44ee90fc70ee19faa0e.poster.avif?t=1759064964\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/574a82fdca34f44ee90fc70ee19faa0e.webm?t=1759064964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/574a82fdca34f44ee90fc70ee19faa0e.mp4?t=1759064964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Combine things!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take ingredients from your droppers and feed them into machines like the Mixer\u2014combine flour and sugar into dry mix, or experiment with more advanced machines as your factory grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/3ae9fde10b77d2c8b8ad3e55c3126365.poster.avif?t=1759064964\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/3ae9fde10b77d2c8b8ad3e55c3126365.webm?t=1759064964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/3ae9fde10b77d2c8b8ad3e55c3126365.mp4?t=1759064964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Contracts!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete contracts to earn money and grow your factory. Work with different companies, deal with changing prices, send donations, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/4ac679cdcac967697909df5298334a2b.poster.avif?t=1759064964\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/4ac679cdcac967697909df5298334a2b.webm?t=1759064964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/4ac679cdcac967697909df5298334a2b.mp4?t=1759064964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>AND MORE...</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional systems, features, and surprises await\u2014but I'm keeping those under wraps (for now).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880880?t=1759064964","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880880?t=1759064964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/5944aac0c9e462189e48a6d5daf068fbbb3de687/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759064964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/5944aac0c9e462189e48a6d5daf068fbbb3de687/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759064964","cate