 class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/3ae9fde10b77d2c8b8ad3e55c3126365.poster.avif?t=1759064964\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/3ae9fde10b77d2c8b8ad3e55c3126365.webm?t=1759064964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/3ae9fde10b77d2c8b8ad3e55c3126365.mp4?t=1759064964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Contracts!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete contracts to earn money and grow your factory. Work with different companies, deal with changing prices, send donations, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/4ac679cdcac967697909df5298334a2b.poster.avif?t=1759064964\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/4ac679cdcac967697909df5298334a2b.webm?t=1759064964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/extras/4ac679cdcac967697909df5298334a2b.mp4?t=1759064964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>AND MORE...</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional systems, features, and surprises await\u2014but I'm keeping those under wraps (for now).</p>","developers":["Lemo-Logic Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880880/137f2689f3436781ea3ca251b3c41ea8030ee339/heade